## Claude Desktop Integration

Add to your Claude Desktop config (`~/.claude/claude_desktop_config.json`):

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "{{serverName}}": {
      "command": "node",
      "args": ["{{serverName}}/dist/index.js"],
      "env": {
        "BASE_URL": "YOUR_BASE_URL"
      }
    }
  }
}
```
